{"parentUuid":"c047fdce-c754-44db-8085-5813c0b44e65","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cdi4cHWbJPPTCD5FMWq6q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"r05.\n\nThe premise is incorrect — there is no GraphQL schema in this project. The public API is defined using **Protocol Buffers (protobuf)** with **gRPC** services that are also exposed as RESTful HTTP endpoints via `google.api.http` annotations.\n\nThe API schema is defined in `.proto` files under `proto/api/v1/`:\n\n- `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto` — Memo CRUD\n- `proto/api/v1/user_service.proto` — User management\n- `proto/api/v1/auth_service.proto` — Authentication\n- `proto/api/v1/attachment_service.proto` — File attachments\n- `proto/api/v1/shortcut_service.proto` — Shortcuts\n- `proto/api/v1/idp_service.proto` — Identity providers\n- `proto/api/v1/instance_service.proto` — Instance settings\n- `proto/api/v1/ai_service.proto` — AI features\n- `proto/api/v1/common.proto` — Shared types\n\nEach service uses `google.api.http` annotations to map gRPC RPCs to REST paths (e.g., `POST /api/v1/memos`, `GET /api/v1/memos`). The Go server implementations live under `server/router/api/v1/`, and generated TypeScript protobuf types are consumed by the frontend from `web/src/types/proto/api/v1/`. Code generation is configured via `proto/buf.gen.yaml`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":566,"cache_read_input_tokens":45767,"output_tokens":371,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":566,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cdi4cEs6W8r1PEtzp7DYe","attributionMcpServer":"gitnexus","attributionMcpTool":"route_map","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3366eb2-4af9-4c09-81a5-2e1e22b2bb79","timestamp":"2026-